rections: Enjoy daily as a healthy breakfast or snack. For a warm, fresh-baked taste, remove bar from wrapper and microwave for 8-10 seconds."}, {"type": "Precautions re: All Other", "notes": "Please use caution, as the bar and icing may be HOT upon removal from microwave."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "GNC GUARANTEE\nIf you are not 100% completely satisfied, return the unused portion of the product with your receipt to a GNC store within 30 days. Our trained sales staff will either refund your purchase price or, if you prefer, assist you in finding a replacement product to help you LIVE WELL."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "Calories: 2,000 2,500 \nTotal Fat Less than 65g 80g \nSat. Fat Less than 20g 25g \nCholesterol Less than 300mg 300mg \nSodium Less than 2,400mg 2,400mg \nTotal Carbohydrate 300g 375g \nDietary Fiber 25g 30g \nCalories per gram: \nFat 9 - Carbohydrate 4 - Protein 4"}, {"type": "Formula re: Contains", "notes": "CONTAINS: Milk, Soybeans and Wheat."}, {"type": "Precautions re: Allergies", "notes": "CONTAINS: Milk, Soybeans and Wheat."}, {"type": "Precautions re: Allergies", "notes": "Manufactured in a Plant That Processes Peanut, Tree Nut, Soy, Wheat, Milk and Egg Products."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "{QR code} SCAN & LEARN MORE"}, {"type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)", "notes": "^In a clinical study of 30 healthy adults (who took Appetrex Control(TM) one week followed by a placebo one week apart, or vice versa) food intake was reduced by nearly 10% when the subjects took Appetrex Control(TM) versus the placebo prior to their first meal at the start of their diet."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "+In a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study of 112 healthy volunteers, subjects taking the GNC vitamin and mineral blend in this improvements in SF-36 Vitality and Mental Health scores compared to those taking a placebo."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "#Clinically proven to increase post workout calorie burning by up to 60% for up to one hour after a workout. This double-blind, placebo-controlled, cross-over study consisted of 22 healthy men and women. Participants exercised on a treadmill on two occasions."}, {"type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)", "notes": "For additional, healthy weight management support, try these scientifically formulated GNC Total Lean(TM) products:\nLive Lean & Fit Pak\n- A complete, healthy lifestyle vitapak program featuring a clinically studied multivitamin providing an array of ingredients that are required for energy, carbohydrate, fat and protein metabolism+*\n- Boost energy, metabolism, and reduced calorie intake by 10^*\n- Enhanced formula includes stress defense nutrients and promotes positive mood support*\nLean Shake(TM)\n- Healthy meal replacement proven effective for weight loss*\n- Helps keep you feeling fuller and more satisfied so you eat less and wait longer between meals*\n- Supports lean muscle mass and a healthy metabolism*\nBurn 60(TM)\n- Powerful thermogenic formula*\n- Boost energy & metabolism*\n- Increases calorie burning by up to 60%#*"}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "CLA\n- A healthy fatty acid, clinically proven to improve body composition*\n- Scientifically shown to improve muscle tone*\n- Fuels energy & fat metabolism*"}, {"type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement", "notes": "*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "WHOLESOME NUTRITION"}, {"type": "Formula re: Contains", "notes": "- 170 Calories\n- 12g Protein\n- 10g Fiber\n- Zero Trans Fat"}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "Natural Flavors"}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "SCIENTIFICALLY FORMULATED"}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "50 G EACH"}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "HEALTHY NUTRITION TO JUMP-START YOUR MORNING!"}, {"type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)", "notes": "GNC Total Lean(TM) Breakfast Squares are a convenient, wholesome bar, packed with nutrients that your body needs to start the day."}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "This isn't your ordinary breakfast bar; it is packed with 12g of muscle fueling protein and 10g of fiber to keep you fuller longer. Each breakfast square is only 170 calories and has zero trans fat, so you don't need to feel guilty while enjoying this great-tasting bar.\nTry all three flavors of our great-tasting Breakfast Squares:\nIced Cinnamon Bun\nOatmeal Chocolate Chip\nStrawberries & Cream"}, {"type": "General Statements: All Other Content", "notes": "NEW"}, {"type": "Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)", "notes": "On one occasion they took Burn 60(TM) before exercise and on the second, they took a placebo. The amount of calories burned during the first hour post-exercise was measured and participants burned up to 60% more calories while on Burn 60(TM) compared to when they took the placebo."}], "targetGroups": ["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"], "thumbnail": "", "upcSku": "", "userGroups": [{"dailyValueTargetGroupName": "Adults and children 4 or more years of age", "langualCode": "P0250", "langualCodeDescription": "Adults and Children 4 years and above"}], "_source": "api"}
